2026-10-28T17:30:21.1901348Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013r4KjKdULQucxZwscgybza","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 17,\n    \"title\": \"[Bug]: aws_db_proxy_default_target_group: removing init_query is never applied (perpetual diff)\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": [\n      \"bug\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-09-07T02:36:11+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Report a Bug\",\n    \"missing_required\": [],\n    \"empty_optional\": [\n      \"Debug Logging\"\n    ],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_db_proxy_default_target_group\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": false,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/rds\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_db_proxy\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/rds\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"regex_labeler_would_apply\": [\n      \"bug\",\n      \"service/rds\"\n    ],\n    \"primary_service_label\": \"service/rds\"\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"terraform\": null,\n    \"provider\": \"6.58.0\",\n    \"latest_release\": \"6.63.0\",\n    \"latest_release_date\": \"2026-09-03\",\n    \"provider_status\": \"outdated\",\n    \"minor_releases_behind\": 5,\n    \"newer_release_notes\": [],\n    \"newer_fixes\": []\n  },\n  \"similar_issues\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": 45738,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#45738\",\n      \"title\": \"aws_db_proxy_target not recreated/updated when aws_db_proxy is destroyed and recreated\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"* aws_db_proxy_target * aws_db_proxy The RDS proxy instance should be recreated AND reconnected to the desired target db. When the RDS proxy is recreated, it is not associated with the desired target DB console Click to expand configuration Using t